# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the experiments have successfully executed, we now post-process the measurement counts to extract meaningful metrics.\n"
"In this step, we do the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah eksperimen berjaya dilaksanakan, kita kini memproses kiraan pengukuran untuk mengekstrak metrik yang bermakna.\n"
"Dalam langkah ini, kita lakukan perkara berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Define quality metrics for evaluating the performance of the long-range "
