msgstr "Takrifkan metrik kualiti untuk menilai prestasi CX jarak jauh.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compute expectation values of Pauli operators from raw measurement "
"outcomes.\n"
msgstr "Kira nilai jangkaan operator Pauli daripada hasil pengukuran mentah.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use these to calculate the fidelity of the generated Bell state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan nilai-nilai ini untuk mengira kesetiaan keadaan Bell yang dijana.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In a noiseless simulation, we will verify that the fidelity metric is $1$ "
"for the circuits constructed. In the experiments on the real QPUs, this "
"analysis will provide a clear picture of how well the dynamic circuits "
"perform relative to the unitary baseline implementation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam simulasi tanpa hingar, kita akan sahkan bahawa metrik kesetiaan adalah"
" $1$ untuk litar yang dibina. Dalam eksperimen pada QPU sebenar, analisis "
"ini akan memberi gambaran jelas tentang seberapa baik Circuit dinamik "
"berprestasi berbanding pelaksanaan garis dasar uniter.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Quality metrics {#quality-metrics}"
msgstr "Metrik kualiti {#quality-metrics}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To evaluate the success of the long-range CX protocol, we measure how close "
"the output state is to the ideal Bell state. A convenient way to quantify "
"this is by computing the state fidelity using expectation values of Pauli "
"operators. We can compute fidelity for a Bell state on the control and "
"target state after knowing the $\\braket{XX}$, $\\braket{YY}$, and "
"$\\braket{ZZ}$. In particular,\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menilai kejayaan protokol CX jarak jauh, kita ukur sejauh mana keadaan"
" output menghampiri keadaan Bell yang ideal. Cara yang mudah untuk mengukur "
"ini ialah dengan mengira kesetiaan keadaan menggunakan nilai jangkaan "
"operator Pauli. Kita boleh mengira kesetiaan untuk keadaan Bell pada keadaan"
" kawalan dan sasaran selepas mengetahui $\\braket{XX}$, $\\braket{YY}$, dan "
"$\\braket{ZZ}$. Khususnya,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$ F = \\frac{1}{4} (1 + \\braket{XX} - \\braket{YY} + \\braket{ZZ})$$\n"
msgstr "$$ F = \\frac{1}{4} (1 + \\braket{XX} - \\braket{YY} + \\braket{ZZ})$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To compute these expectation values from raw measurement data, we define a "
"set of helper functions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengira nilai jangkaan ini daripada data pengukuran mentah, kita "
"takrifkan satu set fungsi pembantu:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`compute_ZZ_expectation`**: Given measurement counts, computes the "
"expectation value of a two-qubit Pauli operator in the $Z$ basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`compute_ZZ_expectation`**: Diberi kiraan pengukuran, mengira nilai "
"jangkaan operator Pauli dua-Qubit dalam asas $Z$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`compute_fidelity`**: Combines the expectation values of $XX$, $YY$, and "
"$ZZ$ into the fidelity expression above.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`compute_fidelity`**: Menggabungkan nilai jangkaan $XX$, $YY$, dan $ZZ$ ke"
" dalam ungkapan kesetiaan di atas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`get_counts_from_bitarray`**: Utility to extract counts from backend "
"result objects.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`get_counts_from_bitarray`**: Utiliti untuk mengekstrak kiraan daripada "
"objek keputusan Backend.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As expected in a noiseless simulation, the fidelities in both dynamic "
"circuits and unitary circuits are $1$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang dijangkakan dalam simulasi tanpa hingar, kesetiaan dalam kedua-"
"dua litar dinamik dan litar uniter adalah $1$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"
msgstr "Contoh perkakasan skala besar {#large-scale-hardware-example}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
